<title>FRANCE: Block of 100,000 Havas shares traded.</title>
<headline>Block of 100,000 Havas shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block trade of 100,000 shares in Havas was concluded at 479 francs at 0938 GMT, dealers said.</p>
<p>The media group was up 2.21 percent at 477 francs at 1020 GMT in a volume of 330,280 shares.</p>
</text>
